# Design differentiation

## Preloader

- `Boot.js`, `LoadingScreen.js`, `.c-loading`
- Crni full-screen `--lf-soot` + logo
- Stanja: `is-loading` → `has-dom-ready`

## Archetype: stari restoran

Orah, mjed, bjelokost, vino. Tipografski hero. Foto-forward u ostatku scrolla.

Scroll: hero → istorija → specijalitet → jelovnik → anegdota → galerija → footer.

